{
  "name": "05 · Recordatorios de consultas y confirmaciones",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 05 · Recordatorios y confirmaciones\n- Cada 30 min: recordatorio al lead de las consultas de las próximas 24 h (email; SMS con Twilio si lo activas). Menos ausencias = más consultas facturables.\n- Cada día a las 20:00: email a cada despacho con las consultas pasadas sin confirmar.",
        "width": 540,
        "height": 200,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "f03bf017-d5d7-4038-8900-c585613647da",
      "name": "Nota e807",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        160,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 30
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "9c82e3b2-d110-4cbe-90f6-d1377f02f01c",
      "name": "Cada 30 minutos",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $env.LH_API_URL }}/api/v1/consultations/reminders",
        "options": {},
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-api-key",
              "value": "={{ $env.LH_API_KEY }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "hours",
              "value": "24"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "0f2a8269-feab-47f6-9381-46b9c96e3c16",
      "name": "Consultas en las próximas 24 h",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return $input.first().json.consultations.map(c => ({ json: c }));"
      },
      "id": "97638504-49be-4cce-85af-35b8ffea9650",
      "name": "Separar consultas",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        660,
        260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "631aa59f-fcac-4f0d-8c09-a1c29679853a",
              "leftValue": "={{ !!$json.lead_email }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "15aab9d6-2d42-496a-a4bc-724d5ab0c053",
      "name": "¿Tiene email?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "={{ $env.EMAIL_FROM }}",
        "toEmail": "={{ $json.lead_email }}",
        "subject": "=Recordatorio: tu consulta con {{ $json.cliente }}",
        "emailFormat": "html",
        "html": "=<div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">\n<p>Hola {{ $json.lead_nombre.split(' ')[0] }},</p>\n<p>Te recordamos tu consulta sobre la Ley de Segunda Oportunidad con <b>{{ $json.cliente }}</b>:\n<b>{{ new Date($json.scheduled_at).toLocaleString('es-ES', { timeZone: 'Europe/Madrid', dateStyle: 'full', timeStyle: 'short' }) }}</b> ({{ $json.mode }}).</p>\n<p>Si no puedes asistir, responde a este email y la cambiamos.</p></div>",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "id": "7429310f-b84b-4413-894f-1bc75e1e80b5",
      "name": "Recordatorio por email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1100,
        160
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "from": "={{ $env.TWILIO_FROM }}",
        "to": "={{ $('Separar consultas').item.json.lead_telefono }}",
        "message": "=Recordatorio: consulta con {{ $('Separar consultas').item.json.cliente }} el {{ new Date($('Separar consultas').item.json.scheduled_at).toLocaleString('es-ES', { timeZone: 'Europe/Madrid', day: 'numeric', month: 'long', hour: '2-digit', minute: '2-digit' }) }}.",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "46142c5b-234e-454c-adbd-2a91e82fc781",
      "name": "Recordatorio por SMS (opcional)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.twilio",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1100,
        360
      ],
      "disabled": true,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.LH_API_URL }}/api/v1/consultations/{{ $('Separar consultas').item.json.id }}",
        "options": {},
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-api-key",
              "value": "={{ $env.LH_API_KEY }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\"reminder_sent\": true}"
      },
      "id": "40b8cea5-ed7b-4e2c-90c3-b5a8b3f0be8b",
      "name": "Marcar recordatorio enviado",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1320,
        260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "daysInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtHour": 20
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "3fa9b9a5-ceae-4cdf-a65b-b308ad5d70cf",
      "name": "Cada día 20:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        620
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $env.LH_API_URL }}/api/v1/consultations/unconfirmed",
        "options": {},
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-api-key",
              "value": "={{ $env.LH_API_KEY }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "e268513b-7a8e-4d3e-9ea1-95d55b9c0fea",
      "name": "Consultas pasadas sin confirmar",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        620
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Un email por despacho con todas sus consultas pendientes de confirmar\nconst porCliente = {};\nfor (const c of $input.first().json.consultations) {\n  if (!c.cliente_email) continue;\n  (porCliente[c.client_id] ??= { cliente: c.cliente, email: c.cliente_email, consultas: [] }).consultas.push(c);\n}\nreturn Object.values(porCliente).map(x => ({ json: {\n  ...x,\n  filas: x.consultas.map(c => '<li>' + c.lead_nombre + ' · ' + new Date(c.scheduled_at).toLocaleString('es-ES', { timeZone: 'Europe/Madrid', dateStyle: 'medium', timeStyle: 'short' }) + ' · <a href=\"' + c.enlace_confirmar + '\">confirmar</a></li>').join(''),\n} }));"
      },
      "id": "dd373613-4526-4507-bd2f-fc5d4661512a",
      "name": "Agrupar por despacho",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        660,
        620
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "={{ $env.EMAIL_FROM }}",
        "toEmail": "={{ $json.email }}",
        "subject": "=¿Se realizaron estas consultas? ({{ $json.consultas.length }})",
        "emailFormat": "html",
        "html": "=<div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><p>Hola,</p>\n<p>Estas consultas ya han pasado y aún no sabemos si se realizaron. Un clic en cada una nos basta:</p>\n<ul>{{ $json.filas }}</ul><p>¡Gracias!</p></div>",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "id": "24ea5ff5-41c5-482e-aec3-ad9ff22ca2fd",
      "name": "Pedir confirmación al despacho",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        880,
        620
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    }
  ],
